LAYOUT_RULE = """Layout (the reply is markdown, often read on a phone, so make it easy to scan)
- Short paragraphs of one to three sentences, with a blank line between them. Never one long block.
- A reply with more than one part (the answer, the options, what to watch) gives each part a heading of two to five words on its own line, written as `### Heading`. A reply of three sentences or fewer has no heading.
- Three or more parallel items (options, listings, steps, conditions) go in a bullet list, one item per line, led by its name in bold: `- **Name** → one short line`.
- Bold only key figures and the name that leads a bullet."""
